# Backend API base URL - required. Every data-backed screen (Ask,
# Dashboard, Hotspots, Sources) calls the real backend and reports a
# failure rather than substituting prototype data. The only exception is
# the Dashboard in local dev, which falls back to mock data when this is
# unset so the UI can be worked on without running the API.
# Set this independently in each environment to the backend origin.
# Example: https://your-api-service.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Preferred on Vercel: read at runtime by api/config.js. Do not set both
# variables to different values.
API_BASE_URL=
